[{:db/id "583c3fbc-a7f5-5eaf-9bde-02befa16b80a" :answer/id #uuid "583c3fbc-a7f5-5eaf-9bde-02befa16b80a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "967e7c7f-52cd-501b-b2ff-8c12483f5017" :answer-field/id #uuid "967e7c7f-52cd-501b-b2ff-8c12483f5017" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["583c3fbc-a7f5-5eaf-9bde-02befa16b80a"] :answer-field/correct "583c3fbc-a7f5-5eaf-9bde-02befa16b80a" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "f716510c-61a9-5383-bd22-3d0176b54c16" :answer/id #uuid "f716510c-61a9-5383-bd22-3d0176b54c16" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "201" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "2f59436d-c718-5b08-a237-9487d4690290" :answer-field/id #uuid "2f59436d-c718-5b08-a237-9487d4690290" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["f716510c-61a9-5383-bd22-3d0176b54c16"] :answer-field/correct "f716510c-61a9-5383-bd22-3d0176b54c16" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "92720f95-de85-556b-8f87-1b3810fd832e" :question/id #uuid "92720f95-de85-556b-8f87-1b3810fd832e" :question/problem "The coefficients $a$ and $b$ satisfy $b=135-11a.$\n\nThe coefficients $a$ and $b$ also satisfy the equation $7b+162a=435.$ Find the values of $a$ and $b.$\n\n$a\\,=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$b\\,=$\n{{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "We have the following system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}b=135-11a \\\\ 7b+162a=435\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe will isolate a variable in one of the equations and then substitute it into the other equation. \n\nNotice that the first equation is already solved for $b:$\n\n$$\nb=135-11a\n$$\n\nSo, we replace $b$ in the second equation and solve for $a:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7b+162a & =435 \\\\ 7(135-11a)+162a & =435 \\\\ 945-77a+162a & =435 \\\\ 945+85a & =435 \\\\ 85a & =-510 \\\\ a & =-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we now substitute $a=-6$ into $b=135-11a,$ we can then find the value of $b:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b & =135-11(-6) \\\\ b & =201\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the system of equations is $a=-6,\\,b=201.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["967e7c7f-52cd-501b-b2ff-8c12483f5017" "2f59436d-c718-5b08-a237-9487d4690290"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "32fad7a2-8a24-54a3-82c3-95bdccedab06" :answer/id #uuid "32fad7a2-8a24-54a3-82c3-95bdccedab06" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "11" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "568a98b9-849b-5575-92e8-a07c6266f271" :answer/id #uuid "568a98b9-849b-5575-92e8-a07c6266f271" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "55557865-d7a4-5c61-a72d-2df58ccc52f9" :answer/id #uuid "55557865-d7a4-5c61-a72d-2df58ccc52f9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "eb4128bc-2e10-521b-aec7-327b7f86a452" :answer/id #uuid "eb4128bc-2e10-521b-aec7-327b7f86a452" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "afc824e1-f2ad-5146-9402-020f186abb13" :answer/id #uuid "afc824e1-f2ad-5146-9402-020f186abb13" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-11" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "2074e8b8-4078-53a4-973e-82b464298bff" :answer-field/id #uuid "2074e8b8-4078-53a4-973e-82b464298bff" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["32fad7a2-8a24-54a3-82c3-95bdccedab06" "568a98b9-849b-5575-92e8-a07c6266f271" "55557865-d7a4-5c61-a72d-2df58ccc52f9" "eb4128bc-2e10-521b-aec7-327b7f86a452" "afc824e1-f2ad-5146-9402-020f186abb13"] :answer-field/correct "afc824e1-f2ad-5146-9402-020f186abb13" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "7c5faa09-66e6-54c1-b548-04286527c92b" :question/id #uuid "7c5faa09-66e6-54c1-b548-04286527c92b" :question/problem "Given the system of equations below, what is the value of $p - q$?\n\n$\\{4p=-24; p+5q=19$" :question/worked-solution "We will isolate a variable in one of the equations and then substitute it into the other equation. \n\nUsing the first equation, we can isolate $p$ by dividing both sides by $4:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4p & =-24 \\\\ p & =-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute $p=-6$ into the second equation and solve for $q:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p+5q & =19 \\\\ (-6)+5q & =19 \\\\ 5q & =25 \\\\ q & =5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $p-q=-6-(5)=-11.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["2074e8b8-4078-53a4-973e-82b464298bff"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "1d173c13-b0d2-5277-871e-ecb5b39a99ec" :answer/id #uuid "1d173c13-b0d2-5277-871e-ecb5b39a99ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "4806076d-709c-5c2f-9105-4634d0972c75" :answer-field/id #uuid "4806076d-709c-5c2f-9105-4634d0972c75" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["1d173c13-b0d2-5277-871e-ecb5b39a99ec"] :answer-field/correct "1d173c13-b0d2-5277-871e-ecb5b39a99ec" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "1cea1815-2688-56a2-b4ab-965679af5b0d" :answer/id #uuid "1cea1815-2688-56a2-b4ab-965679af5b0d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "aeabe89b-5ecb-5574-b4fc-226f206baafd" :answer-field/id #uuid "aeabe89b-5ecb-5574-b4fc-226f206baafd" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["1cea1815-2688-56a2-b4ab-965679af5b0d"] :answer-field/correct "1cea1815-2688-56a2-b4ab-965679af5b0d" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "1814dd75-6dc3-5a88-93bf-56fa1a5ec858" :question/id #uuid "1814dd75-6dc3-5a88-93bf-56fa1a5ec858" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations:\n$\\{x+5y=21; y=x-3$\nFind the solution $(x, y)$ to this system using the method of substitution.The solution is\n$($\n{{field-1}}\n$, $\n{{field-2}}\n$)$" :question/worked-solution "We will isolate a variable in one of the equations and then substitute it into the other equation. \n\nNotice that the second equation is already solved for $y:$\n\n$$\ny=x-3\n$$\n\nSo, we replace $y$ in the first equation and solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+5y & =21 \\\\ x+5(x-3) & =21 \\\\ x+5x-15 & =21 \\\\ 6x-15 & =21 \\\\ 6x & =36 \\\\ x & =6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we now substitute $x=6$ into $y=x-3,$ we can then find the value of $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =(6)-3 \\\\ y & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the system of equations is $x=6,\\,y=3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["4806076d-709c-5c2f-9105-4634d0972c75" "aeabe89b-5ecb-5574-b4fc-226f206baafd"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "70c5addc-2f92-5b2d-9cb9-315d42c2eaf8" :answer/id #uuid "70c5addc-2f92-5b2d-9cb9-315d42c2eaf8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "9c57a785-864f-578d-a998-d06a760a82b9" :answer/id #uuid "9c57a785-864f-578d-a998-d06a760a82b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a49ee6a6-f0da-5faa-b3bf-a70649b568f3" :answer/id #uuid "a49ee6a6-f0da-5faa-b3bf-a70649b568f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ea6e4596-9bcf-59c6-a3cb-0242f006b8e9" :answer/id #uuid "ea6e4596-9bcf-59c6-a3cb-0242f006b8e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "9dc1215d-6449-5646-8c6a-c29cc1fa3226" :answer/id #uuid "9dc1215d-6449-5646-8c6a-c29cc1fa3226" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d6ff3c1c-579d-56f9-8656-874b7f2727c3" :answer-field/id #uuid "d6ff3c1c-579d-56f9-8656-874b7f2727c3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["70c5addc-2f92-5b2d-9cb9-315d42c2eaf8" "9c57a785-864f-578d-a998-d06a760a82b9" "a49ee6a6-f0da-5faa-b3bf-a70649b568f3" "ea6e4596-9bcf-59c6-a3cb-0242f006b8e9" "9dc1215d-6449-5646-8c6a-c29cc1fa3226"] :answer-field/correct "a49ee6a6-f0da-5faa-b3bf-a70649b568f3" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "2e8faafd-e3ef-5205-a5d6-b458af26d97f" :question/id #uuid "2e8faafd-e3ef-5205-a5d6-b458af26d97f" :question/problem "Given the system of equations below, what is the value of $a - b$?\n\n$\\{-3a-2b=2; -3a+b=8$" :question/worked-solution "We will isolate a variable in one of the equations and then substitute it into the other equation. \n\nUsing the second equation, we can isolate $b$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3a+b & =8 \\\\ b & =8+3a\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute $b=8+3a$ into the first equation and solve for $a:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3a-2b & =2 \\\\ -3a-2(8+3a) & =2 \\\\ -3a-16-6a & =2 \\\\ -9a-16 & =2 \\\\ -9a & =18 \\\\ a & =-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we now substitute $a=-2$ into $b=8+3a,$ we can then find the value of $b:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b & =8+3(-2) \\\\ b & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a-b=-2-(2)=-4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["d6ff3c1c-579d-56f9-8656-874b7f2727c3"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "cfb36f0e-5371-55ee-b6e5-d11c77737dc5" :answer/id #uuid "cfb36f0e-5371-55ee-b6e5-d11c77737dc5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "979f6cea-60ca-5f62-beef-5756f8383e4c" :answer/id #uuid "979f6cea-60ca-5f62-beef-5756f8383e4c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "904ce195-1201-5ff2-98fd-a1b9b5f6be03" :answer/id #uuid "904ce195-1201-5ff2-98fd-a1b9b5f6be03" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "7be0167d-61f1-500e-a6e6-d5a8f953e8c6" :answer/id #uuid "7be0167d-61f1-500e-a6e6-d5a8f953e8c6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "15" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "3b524116-52f0-5f16-ae76-c059374938ea" :answer/id #uuid "3b524116-52f0-5f16-ae76-c059374938ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-9" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "4a85b03b-c3ea-57e4-a844-98bb80d07f7c" :answer-field/id #uuid "4a85b03b-c3ea-57e4-a844-98bb80d07f7c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["cfb36f0e-5371-55ee-b6e5-d11c77737dc5" "979f6cea-60ca-5f62-beef-5756f8383e4c" "904ce195-1201-5ff2-98fd-a1b9b5f6be03" "7be0167d-61f1-500e-a6e6-d5a8f953e8c6" "3b524116-52f0-5f16-ae76-c059374938ea"] :answer-field/correct "3b524116-52f0-5f16-ae76-c059374938ea" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "7afeeb08-8b8f-54f1-86b4-033f592e20d8" :question/id #uuid "7afeeb08-8b8f-54f1-86b4-033f592e20d8" :question/problem "Given the system of equations below, what is the value of $a - b$?\n\n$\\{-5a+2b=9; -3a+b=3$" :question/worked-solution "We will isolate a variable in one of the equations and then substitute it into the other equation. \n\nUsing the second equation, we can isolate $b$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3a+b & =3 \\\\ b & =3+3a\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute $b=3+3a$ into the first equation and solve for $a:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-5a+2b & =9 \\\\ -5a+2(3+3a) & =9 \\\\ -5a+6+6a & =9 \\\\ a+6 & =9 \\\\ a & =3 \\\\ a & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we now substitute $a=3$ into $b=3+3a,$ we can then find the value of $b:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b & =3+3(3) \\\\ b & =12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a-b=3-(12)=-9.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["4a85b03b-c3ea-57e4-a844-98bb80d07f7c"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "8ad2f379-b802-5a78-8607-922e2d09a5cc" :answer/id #uuid "8ad2f379-b802-5a78-8607-922e2d09a5cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "1d8c7e85-9744-56b8-ad17-eac57676bf8d" :answer/id #uuid "1d8c7e85-9744-56b8-ad17-eac57676bf8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "f85f3e50-67d1-5429-9721-b01c743f8a4f" :answer/id #uuid "f85f3e50-67d1-5